      "en": "“Call now; is there any who will answer you? To which of the holy ones will you turn?",
      "ko": "부르짖어 보아라 네게 응답할 자가 있겠느냐 거룩한 자 중에 네가 누구에게로 향하겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "96215ba7f96d9693d3ae8e092a520cfe11c71a81a6c4b4a63a4083ae8247de9b",
      "translation_text_hash": "02ea258f91da966b9928c90579552ed3b4fe8e78789a22a6a1b2b53d000ce955",
